## 5. Key Relationships

```
users.agent_id ──────► agents.id             (1-to-1: user account ↔ agent profile)
users.id ◄──────── sites.chef_id             (1-to-many: user manages multiple sites)
agents.id ◄──── affectations.agent_id        (1-to-many: agent has multiple assignments)
sites.id  ◄──── affectations.site_id         (1-to-many: site has multiple agents)
agents.id ◄──── presences.agent_id           (1-to-many: agent has daily attendance records)
agents.id ◄──── demandes.agent_id            (1-to-many: agent submits ticket requests)
users.id  ◄──── demandes.valide_par          (1-to-many: user validates requests)
agents.id ◄──── rapports.agent_id            (1-to-many: agent has reports)
users.id  ◄──── rapports.created_by          (1-to-many: chef creates reports)
sites.id  ◄──── rapports.site_id             (1-to-many: site has reports)
```

